message: "If you use this benchmark or its run records, please cite the paper below."
title: "How Much Does Physics Buy You? A Physics-Informed vs Black-Box Benchmark for Greenhouse Climate Control"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Davarynejad"
    given-names: "Mohsen"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5376-3680"
