date-released: "2026-10-11"
keywords:
  - greenhouse climate control
  - benchmark
  - model predictive control
  - reinforcement learning
  - physics-informed control
  - data efficiency
abstract: >-
  Benchmark code, committed run records and the analysis pipeline for a controlled comparison
  of rule-based, black-box reinforcement learning (PPO, SAC), physics-only economic NMPC and
  physics-informed RL-in-MPC control on the GreenLight-Gym2 greenhouse simulator: four held-out
  weather years, a six-level controller-model mismatch ladder, five seeds, 284 seasons. Every
  number in the paper regenerates from the committed anchor record. All results are simulated.
